/target
.DS_Store

# The library's own lock stays out. `solid_rs` is a library, so consumers
# resolve their own versions and a lock committed here would never be the one
# they build against.
#
# Anchored, not bare `Cargo.lock`. A bare pattern matches at every depth, and
# it was silently swallowing `crates/solidrs-wasm-smoke/Cargo.lock`, which is
# the one lock in this repository that has to be committed. See that
# directory's own .gitignore.
/Cargo.lock
Cargo.lock
